OL,3,AEU tariffs aimed at China hitting
OL,4,AUkraine, steel boss says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of one of Ukraine's biggest
OL,7,Fsteel companies has called on the
OL,8,FEuropean Union to drop import
OL,9,Frestrictions on products made from the
OL,10,Fcountry, arguing it has been "bundled
OL,11,Ftogether" in measures aimed a curbing
OL,12,Fcheap imports from the likes of China.
OL,14,FYuriy Ryzhenkov, chief executive of
OL,15,FMetinvest, told the BBC the
OL,16,Frecently-imposed tariffs on imported
OL,17,Fsteel to the EU were "unfair" and had
OL,18,Fbeen put in place "without any
OL,19,Fconsideration for the situation Ukraine
OL,20,Fis in".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
